{"4294000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rootwarden", "steam_appid": 4294000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design and drop your droids to fight, build, and conquer. Mine resources and outlast the relentless swarm to claim the planet.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT. HARVEST. CONQUER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy modular droids to establish fortified outposts and secure vital minerals. In this high-octane conquest, you don’t just survive—you crush the hive and claim the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294000/extras/931479e4dd8ceb8fddd60714fc28ce1b.poster.avif?t=1778706956\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294000/extras/931479e4dd8ceb8fddd60714fc28ce1b.webm?t=1778706956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294000/extras/931479e4dd8ceb8fddd60714fc28ce1b.mp4?t=1778706956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODULAR DROID ENGINEERING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to survive by designing specialized machines from modular components. In the ship’s Laboratory, customize every droid with interchangeable parts: swap chassis for durability, equip drills for profit, or mount heavy cannons for defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294000/extras/472b69633f2c07f495532e0bb2b5c21b.poster.avif?t=1778706956\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294000/extras/472b69633f2c07f495532e0bb2b5c21b.webm?t=1778706956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294000/extras/472b69633f2c07f495532e0bb2b5c21b.mp4?t=1778706956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ORBITAL COMMAND HUB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oversee every operation from the bridge of your colonization ship. Coordinate combat from a tactical overhead view, provide real-time support to units on the ground, and upgrade your fleet's efficiency between drops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294000/extras/089f9ed27a99bca788070f4909b3837f.poster.avif?t=1778706956\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294000/extras/089f9ed27a99bca788070f4909b3837f.webm?t=1778706956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294000/extras/089f9ed27a99bca788070f4909b3837f.mp4?t=1778706956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design and drop your droids to fight, build, and conquer. Mine resources and outlast the relentless swarm to claim the planet.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT. HARVEST. CONQUER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy modular droids to establish fortified outposts and secure vital minerals. In this high-octane conquest, you don’t just survive—you crush the hive and claim the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294000/extras/931479e4dd8ceb8fddd60714fc28ce1b.poster.avif?